    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2718450/extras/bca30e4c1a169206df9b3242a0bbe341.avif?t=1749279994\" width=600 height=184 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u26a0\ufe0f Important:</strong><br>Currently, only the <strong>prologue</strong> of the game is available, with an estimated playtime of <strong>30 minutes</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Future chapters (<strong>Part 1 and Part 2</strong>) will be released as <strong>free updates</strong> for all existing players.<br>However, the price of the game will increase with each new release:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u20ac3.99</strong> when Part 1 is released</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u20ac5.99</strong> when Part 2 is released </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2718450/extras/ecdc132fb3b510f09c18506653cbca98.avif?t=1749279994\" data-has-big width=800 height=164 /></span>You are <strong>David Campbell</strong>. You remember nothing. All you know is that you\u2019re trapped in an endless maze.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you search for answers, a specialized organization in the Backrooms will offer help\u2026 sometimes. But this place doesn\u2019t forgive the unprepared. If you want to survive, you\u2019ll have to adapt. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2718450/extras/15a231605da0d26a98b1aa3e69d56bfe.avif?t=1749279994\" data-has-big width=800 height=164 /></span>A A first-person horror game that combines puzzles, intense chases, and an oppressive atmosphere. Every step could be your last, and every decision will determine whether you escape or remain trapped forever. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2718450/extras/19941f0e51e783747a257c691dd788a9.avif?t=1749279994\" data-has-big width=800 height=164 /></span>We\u2019ve crafted a unique atmosphere to fully immerse you in the Backrooms. The tension never truly fades: there are moments of calm, but the feeling of being watched never disappears.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2718450/extras/bca30e4c1a169206df9b3242a0bbe341.avif?t=1749279994\" width=600 height=184 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u26a0\ufe0f Important:</strong><br>Currently, only the <strong>prologue</strong> of the game is available, with an estimated playtime of <strong>30 minutes</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Future chapters (<strong>Part 1 and Part 2</strong>) will be released as <strong>free updates</strong> for all existing players.<br>However, the price of the game will increase with each new release:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u20ac3.99</strong> when Part 1 is released</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u20ac5.99</strong> when Part 2 is released </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2718450/extras/ecdc132fb3b510f09c18506653cbca98.avif?t=1749279994\" data-has-big width=800 height=164 /></span>You are <strong>David Campbell</strong>. You remember nothing. All you know is that you\u2019re trapped in an endless maze.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you search for answers, a specialized organization in the Backrooms will offer help\u2026 sometimes. But this place doesn\u2019t forgive the unprepared. If you want to survive, you\u2019ll have to adapt. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2718450/extras/15a231605da0d26a98b1aa3e69d56bfe.avif?t=1749279994\" data-has-big width=800 height=164 /></span>A A first-person horror game that combines puzzles, intense chases, and an oppressive atmosphere. Every step could be your last, and every decision will determine whether you escape or remain trapped forever. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2718450/extras/19941f0e51e783747a257c691dd788a9.avif?t=1749279994\" data-has-big width=800 height=164 /></span>We\u2019ve crafted a unique atmosphere to fully immerse you in the Backrooms. The tension never truly fades: there are moments of calm, but the feeling of being watched never disappears.</p>",
    "short_description": "Are you ready to survive in this hostile world? Discover who you are and how you ended up in this dimension. But don't worry, you can rely on warm company that will make your experience much more 'pleasant.' Oh, and good luck, you'll need it.",
